      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从重视综合实力变得偏向重视速度。\n这种变化从以前起就有越来越明显的趋势……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e342e4c3c26426b07ccb050e6ee330dbdfa7bc7937e2fc483f610e5e6bb46694",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074116.json",
